# Vault manual

The operating manual for `[[= vault =]]`, [[= owner =]]'s knowledge base. Anyone who changes this vault, a person or any agent tool, follows it. `AGENTS.md` at the vault root is the entrypoint: folder map, the short loop, common commands. This page is the index: reading order, roles, common requests, precedence, and which pages the kit manages.

